[{"id":"920283552431988736","date":1508247671000,"rawContent":"As someone who teaches harassment awareness and prevention (and investigates claims) for 31 years ,yes,most workplaces have an issue.\n#MeToo https:\/\/t.co\/JTlpZANGyG","media":null,"username":"DavidLewisHR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920284094851964929","date":1508247800000,"rawContent":"In cases of workplace harassment:\n\nRule # 1 - Assume the complaint is true\/valid until proven otherwise.\n\nThere is no rule #2.\n\n#MeToo","media":null,"username":"DavidLewisHR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":2,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"921403552316186625","date":1508514700000,"rawContent":"If you're serious about changing culture to address harassment issues make sure that ALL C-level executives attend the training #MeToo","media":null,"username":"DavidLewisHR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":3,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"922447764008722433","date":1508763659000,"rawContent":"I've investigated harassment claims over a 31 yr career, and the (huge?) challenge\/reality is the need to determine who is the liar. #MeToo https:\/\/t.co\/pm2p0qUmKs","media":null,"username":"DavidLewisHR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":4,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"922873333963780096","date":1508865123000,"rawContent":"Thanks @MSNBCYourBiz for retweeting this clip from last year on Managing\/Preventing Harassment in workplaces of ALL sizes. #Training #MeToo https:\/\/t.co\/NjUuQBTxQd","media":null,"username":"DavidLewisHR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":5,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"929344606621392896","date":1510407995000,"rawContent":"After 25+ years of investigating claims of workplace harassment I can safely say that over 95% of claims have significant to absolute merit. How long it takes for the victim to come forward should not diminish their credibility. #MeToo men","media":null,"username":"DavidLewisHR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"929344912037961728","date":1510408068000,"rawContent":"Investigating claims of harassment all too often means that you will have to make the (occassionally) difficult decision of deciding who is the liar.  #MeToo","media":null,"username":"DavidLewisHR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":7,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"932952103018000384","date":1511268089000,"rawContent":"We've gone from being asked to provide Harassment Prevention and Awareness Training to providing what feels more like How to be a Respectful Human Being training. #MeToo #harassment","media":null,"username":"DavidLewisHR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":8,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"935573441675251714","date":1511893065000,"rawContent":"As holiday party season starts all employers need to consider limits on alcohol, rethink having dance music, assign \"an adult\" to the task of monitoring behavior and impairment, and still expect an incident or two. #Harassment #MeToo","media":null,"username":"DavidLewisHR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":9,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"941001866250477569","date":1513187302000,"rawContent":"Where is #SHRM as HR professionals are being called out as not being responsive to complaints of harassment? Their voice is needed here to defend the integrity of the profession. This mission statement (below) implies their voice should already have been heard. #MeToo #HR https:\/\/t.co\/6c9whZw8tW","media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/DQ8cDeXX4